cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Geothermal Suitability Screening — Po Plain (Piemonte)"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2025-01-01"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  A reproducible Python workflow that screens legacy hydrocarbon wells in the
  Piemonte sector of the Po Plain for geothermal reuse, using bottom-hole
  temperature archives, Horner/hybrid corrections, a transparent multi-criteria
  suitability classification, and cross-validated inverse-distance interpolation
  of the geothermal gradient.
keywords:
  - geothermal energy
  - well reuse
  - bottom-hole temperature
  - spatial interpolation
  - energy transition
  - Po Plain
authors:
  - family-names: Saghafifar
    given-names: Iman
repository-code: "https://github.com/imansgh/geothermal-suitability-piemonte"
url: "https://github.com/imansgh/geothermal-suitability-piemonte"
